msgctxt "#32022"
msgid "Only applies when the image proxy uses wsrv.nl. Resizes newly scraped images and previews; refresh existing library entries to update their URLs."
msgstr "僅在圖片代理使用 wsrv.nl 時生效。縮放新刮削的圖片及預覽圖；已有媒體庫項目需重新整理後才能更新圖片位址。"

msgctxt "#32023"
msgid "Enter a positive integer in pixels, or leave empty to keep the original size. Preserves aspect ratio and never enlarges smaller images. Movie sets use the same limits."
msgstr "填寫正整數（像素），留空表示不縮放。保持圖片比例，只縮小、不放大。電影集使用相同類型的寬度設定。"
